  "comment": "We hope as we are ready each country will have their very own ENUM Server and receive a delegation from e164.arpa. For Indonesia, it would be 2.6.e164.arpa for handling country code (+62). To understand how ENUM works, one needs to understand how a Domain Name System (DNS) works as ENUM uses DNS Server. Thus, ENUM works fairly similar to DNS but to map and to delegate a phone number. Please note",
